{
  "dom_id": "questionExplanation-82158",
  "name": null,
  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "To simplify the expression, we write the term under the radical as a perfect cube, and simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt[3]{\\frac{{x}^{6}}{{p}^{6}}} & = \\\\ \\sqrt[3]{(\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{p}^{2}})\\cdot (\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{p}^{2}})\\cdot (\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{p}^{2}})} & = \\\\ \\sqrt[3]{{(\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{p}^{2}})}^{3}} & = \\\\ \\frac{{x}^{2}}{{p}^{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
